// The brain is a small neural network. This lesson does not use it yet.
brain racing-starter

// This block runs for every car, 30 times per second of driving.
each tick {
  // steer goes from -1 (right) to 1 (left). pedal goes from -1 (brake) to 1 (full throttle).
